1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:05,380
Hello. I live in the Gharb plain,
downstream on the Sebou River, in Morocco.

2
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:08,130
Look at these fields,
these houses and this road.

3
00:00:08,170 --> 00:00:10,110
This is where we live and work.

4
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:11,700
But when the river overflows,

5
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:14,350
our daily life can be
turned completely upside down.

6
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:19,480
In our region, floods have already
submerged farmland

7
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,650
and cut off some villages.

8
00:00:21,690 --> 00:00:23,260
When the fields are under water,

9
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:25,520
how can we keep working?

10
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:27,280
And when the roads are cut,

11
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,350
how do we reach the neighbouring villages?

12
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:32,400
We want to be able to prepare
before this happens again.

13
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:36,310
To do that,
we need your help.

14
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:37,910
The water also comes from upstream,

15
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:41,570
so watching only our village
is not enough.

16
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:45,010
Help us identify the areas
most exposed to flooding.

17
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:47,310
Study the river and the rainfall,

18
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:50,100
then prepare a plan
to protect farmland,

19
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:52,320
roads and villages
across the whole basin.

20
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:57,410
Above all, warn us early enough
when a flood threatens.

21
00:00:57,450 --> 00:00:59,910
We need enough time
to follow instructions

22
00:00:59,950 --> 00:01:01,460
and get to safety.

23
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:05,090
I ask experts and the authorities
to work with us

24
00:01:05,130 --> 00:01:07,660
to find solutions.
Listen to the residents

25
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:09,780
and help us protect
the places where we live.
